            "effectiveFabricSubnetAddressPrefix": "[if(empty(parameters('fabricSubnetAddressPrefix')), cidrSubnet(parameters('vnetAddressPrefix'), 27, 4), parameters('fabricSubnetAddressPrefix'))]",
